.TH READAHEAD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
readahead \- schedules file data for read-ahead without changing the file offset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B ssize_t readahead(int descriptor, off_t offset, size_t byte_count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Schedules file data for read-ahead without changing the file offset.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR readahead (2)
